    "repo": "xgl",
    "path": "icd/api/include/vk_dispatch.h",
    "explain": "A <code>VkDevice</code>, <code>VkQueue</code> or <code>VkCommandBuffer</code> handle points at a <code>Dispatchable&lt;C&gt;</code>. Its first member, <code>VK_LOADER_DATA</code>, starts as <code>ICD_LOADER_MAGIC</code> and is later overwritten by the loader with its dispatch pointer. The real driver object C sits right after it in raw storage, so C can use virtual functions and inheritance freely.",
