    "explain": "The app's <code>memoryTypeIndex</code> selects the preferred PAL heap through a table built at device init. XGL may then append fallback heaps, for example <code>GpuHeapGartUswc</code> after Local/Invisible when overallocation is allowed. (On Linux, PAL's amdgpu backend uses only <code>heaps[0]</code> to pick the kernel domain; see the domain-table step.)",
