    "title": "How Vulkan heaps are derived from PAL heaps",
    "layer": "xgl",
    "repo": "xgl",
    "path": "icd/api/vk_physical_device.cpp",
    "explain": "At device init XGL walks PAL's four heaps in a fixed priority order and creates one <code>VkMemoryHeap</code> per heap with nonzero size. <b>GartCacheable is never a heap of its own</b>: it shares GartUswc's heap, because both are the same system memory with different CPU caching.",
