    "explain": "Two steps. <code>DRM_AMDGPU_GEM_MMAP</code> returns a fake file offset that identifies the BO, then <code>drm_mmap</code> maps the DRM fd at that offset. Mappings are reference-counted per BO. CPU page faults are served by the kernel from VRAM (through the BAR) or from system pages.",
