    "explain": "The two halves of the back end. <code>LgcLowering::addPasses</code> runs the hardware-aware middle-end passes on a new-PM pass manager. <code>addTargetPasses</code> then sets up the LLVM AMDGPU code generator on a legacy pass manager that writes the object file.",
