    "path": "src/core/hw/gfxip/gfx9/gfx9CmdUtil.cpp",
    "explain": "<code>ACQUIRE_MEM</code> (0x58) makes the CP wait and/or perform cache actions before later work. Note the assert: on GFX11 the RB (color/depth) caches can no longer be flushed through ACQUIRE_MEM. That has to happen at release time.",
