    "explain": "The handoff to hardware. A PM4 <code>INDIRECT_BUFFER</code> packet with PAL's IB address and the <b>VMID</b> in the control word (so the CP translates the IB's VAs through this process's page tables) is written to the ring. The CP then fetches and executes PAL's PM4, including the <code>DRAW_INDEX_AUTO</code> from Topic 4. GFX12's equivalent is <code>gfx_v12_0_ring_emit_ib_gfx</code>.",
